yell 1.1 — licence attribution
==============================

The upstream tarball (yell-1.1.tar.gz, distributed via the FreeBSD
distcache local-distfiles of the port maintainer; project page
www.critical.ch/yell/) does NOT contain a licence file.

The FreeBSD port audio/yell (maintainer ehaupt@FreeBSD.org) records:

    LICENSE=  BSD2CLAUSE

i.e. the 2-clause BSD licence, reproduced below in its standard form.

